// Windows resources.
//
// Resource id 1 is deliberate: SDL3 takes the executable's first RT_GROUP_ICON
// as the window class icon (EnumResourceNames in SDL_windowsevents.c), so this
// one entry supplies the Explorer icon, the title-bar icon, the taskbar icon
// and alt-tab, with no code and no icon file travelling beside the exe.
//
// The path is relative to the project root, which CMake puts on the resource
// compiler's include path: rc.exe resolves a file like this one against its
// working directory and its /I list, and neither of those is the folder this
// file sits in.
1 ICON "assets/icons/daveshot.ico"
